# Certificate authorities that sign Bambu Lab printers' LAN certificates.
#
# Used by backend/app/services/printer_tls.py to verify a printer before its
# access code is sent (MQTT 8883, FTPS 990, camera 322/6000). Only these
# certificates are trusted for printer connections; the system store is not.
#
# Provenance
# ----------
# 1-5: resources/cert/printer.cer from Bambu Lab's own slicer,
#      https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio (AGPL-3.0), commit
#      f75448910c279287556ff8347606c87138c22347 (2025-07-17, "FIX:use a
#      complete certificate"), unchanged. BBL CA (5) is the root a P1S on
#      firmware 01.10.00.00 chains to on 8883, 990 and 6000 (checked 2026-11-13).
#      The two "BBL CA2" roots appear both self-signed and cross-signed by
#      BBL CA.
# 6-8: device intermediates for printers that send only their leaf
#      certificate, from https://github.com/greghesp/ha-bambulab (MIT),
#      custom_components/bambu_lab/pybambu/certs/. Each one verifies against
#      BBL CA2 RSA (1), so they add no trust of their own: OpenSSL only uses
#      them to build a chain to a root above.
#
# SHA-256 fingerprints
# 1. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL CA2 RSA (issuer: BBL CA2 RSA, until Jun 17 01:38:08 2050 GMT)
#    E9:8F:19:57:8B:3F:12:4A:CE:6B:8A:24:7F:FE:DA:52:DC:99:C8:9F:D4:E7:D2:0C:82:82:99:77:B7:F3:35:02
# 2. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL CA2 ECC (issuer: BBL CA2 ECC, until Jun 17 01:38:35 2050 GMT)
#    1F:99:D8:46:71:8C:8D:33:3A:C3:19:CB:8E:70:91:9A:B6:32:36:09:0F:BA:DD:E9:09:BA:4A:6F:08:67:A6:83
# 3. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL CA2 RSA (issuer: BBL CA, until Jun 15 02:01:27 2035 GMT)
#    3D:13:01:9B:45:A4:FA:8A:6C:B8:DC:0F:D7:BE:CB:B1:9B:B2:BF:0C:2F:CB:94:34:A9:34:5F:A5:86:80:DA:0B
# 4. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL CA2 ECC (issuer: BBL CA, until Jun 15 02:01:47 2035 GMT)
#    E8:98:48:32:24:F9:09:2F:57:5D:62:74:33:BB:21:ED:9D:12:5A:77:E3:63:5B:0D:A6:FC:18:FE:85:0A:02:D7
# 5. C = CN, O = "BBL Technologies Co., Ltd", CN = BBL CA (issuer: BBL CA, until Apr  1 03:42:11 2032 GMT)
#    03:0B:CA:81:CE:CE:18:B7:EF:F3:CF:D2:B7:5D:09:D3:EF:CA:89:3B:C0:69:60:9E:37:FA:04:25:7F:E4:D8:40
# 6. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL Device CA O1C2-V2 (issuer: BBL CA2 RSA, until Jul 15 06:10:09 2040 GMT)
#    CE:66:7B:6C:00:1D:26:C3:4E:D9:73:33:FB:60:99:69:94:09:FC:3D:4E:12:42:9C:37:BA:EB:B0:5C:46:C6:0A
# 7. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL Device CA N6-V2 (issuer: BBL CA2 RSA, until Jun 26 08:29:09 2040 GMT)
#    68:BF:31:82:BC:32:D5:A5:45:4F:86:49:28:AB:AA:29:19:41:F6:D5:AC:6A:86:A0:E5:AD:6E:CF:E2:D5:47:7B
# 8. C = CN, O = BBL Technologies Co. Ltd, CN = BBL Device CA N7-V2 (issuer: BBL CA2 RSA, until Jun 26 08:30:54 2040 GMT)
#    6A:85:4D:54:6E:D6:E3:CE:7A:21:12:65:7E:53:F4:55:53:74:41:3E:6F:5C:B5:5F:99:5D:1D:DD:7C:06:DC:69

